          {
            "title": "Local scope",
            "id": 86990,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang dibuat di dalam fungsi memiliki <strong>scope lokal</strong>, seperti <code>bonus</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bonus&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bonus</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang dibuat di dalam fungsi memiliki <strong>scope lokal</strong>. Beri <code>bonus</code> lokal nilai <code>100</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>2000</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bonus</code>, diikuti oleh <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Local scope 2",
            "id": 86991,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan scope lokal, kita hanya bisa mengakses atau memperbarui variabel di dalam fungsi yang membuatnya. Coba atur <code>bonus</code> menjadi <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bonus</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu hanya dapat mengakses atau memperbarui variabel lokal di dalam fungsi yang membuatnya.</p><p>Perbarui <code>bonus</code> agar kode mencetak <code>2100</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>bonus</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Error",
            "id": 86992,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita mencoba mengakses atau memperbarui variabel di luar blok fungsi, seperti <code>bonus</code> di sini, kita akan mendapatkan error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'bonus' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>bonus</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Local scope",
            "id": 87035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kapan sebuah variabel memiliki cakupan lokal?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Saat kita membuatnya di dalam blok fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variabel selalu memiliki scope lokal</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Saat kita membuatnya di dalam blok fungsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu membuat <code>title</code> di luar semua fungsi dan <code>message</code> di dalam <code>greet()</code>. Mana yang memiliki scope lokal?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>message</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code> dan <code>message</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>message</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Local scope 2",
            "id": 87036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa artinya jika sebuah variabel memiliki scope lokal?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita tidak bisa mengakses atau memperbaruinya di luar fungsi tempatnya dibuat</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita dapat mengaksesnya dari mana saja di dalam kode</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita tidak bisa mengakses atau memperbaruinya di luar fungsi tempatnya dibuat.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengakses variabel lokal di luar fungsi yang membuatnya akan menyebabkan error.</p><p>Kamu memanggil fungsi yang membuat <code>discount = 5</code>, lalu mencoba <code>print(discount)</code> di luarnya. Apa yang terjadi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Python melaporkan error karena <code>discount</code> bersifat lokal bagi fungsi.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python menampilkan <code>5</code> karena fungsi membuat variabel tersebut.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python menampilkan <code>None</code> karena variabel berada di luar fungsi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Python melaporkan error karena <code>discount</code> bersifat lokal bagi fungsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error",
            "id": 87037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi ketika kita mencoba mengakses variabel scope lokal di luar fungsi yang membuatnya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita mendapatkan error</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak terjadi apa-apa, kita bisa mengaksesnya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita mendapatkan error.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mencoba mengakses variabel lokal di luar fungsi yang membuatnya akan menyebabkan error.</p><p>Fungsi membuat <code>total</code>. Perubahan mana yang memungkinkan fungsi menampilkan nilai itu tanpa error scope?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pindahkan <code>print(total)</code> ke dalam blok kode fungsi.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Panggil fungsi lebih dahulu, lalu gunakan <code>print(total)</code> di luarnya.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ubah nama <code>total</code> hanya dalam pemanggilan <code>print()</code> di luar.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pindahkan <code>print(total)</code> ke dalam blok kode fungsi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Local scope",
            "id": 87038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat variabel <code>discount</code> yang memiliki scope lokal di dalam fungsi <code>apply_discount</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_discount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"final_price = apply_discount(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(final_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"37\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"30\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>discount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Local scope 2",
            "id": 87039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perbarui variabel <code>discount</code> menjadi <code>10</code> dalam cakupan lokal <code>apply_discount</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"apply_discount\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  discount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"final_price = apply_discount(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(final_price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"40\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>discount = 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Error",
            "id": 87040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tulis kode untuk mencetak pesan sapaan tanpa mengakses variabel <code>greeting</code> di luar scope lokal fungsi <code>greet_user</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{greeting}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi Amy!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>f</code>, <code>\"Hi {user}!\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel <code>greeting</code> bersifat lokal bagi <code>greet_user</code>, jadi tidak dapat digunakan di sini. Buat baris tersendiri yang menampilkan <code>Hi Amy!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet_user\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{greeting}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi \" /><text value=\"{user}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;{greeting} {user}!&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Hi {name}!&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi Amy!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>f</code>, <code>\"Hi {user}!\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 9778,
        "title": "Cakupan global",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Global scope 1",
            "id": 86994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang dibuat di luar blok fungsi memiliki <strong>scope global</strong>, seperti <code>shipping</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>shipping</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang dibuat di luar fungsi memiliki <strong>scope global</strong>, sehingga fungsi dapat membacanya. Buat <code>shipping</code> bernilai <code>10</code> agar menampilkan <code>64</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"cart\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>shipping</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Global access",
            "id": 86995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan scope global, kita bisa dengan aman <strong>mengakses</strong> variabel di mana saja dalam kode, seperti yang kita lakukan dengan <code>shipping</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"64\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>shipping</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Global scope 2",
            "id": 86996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Semua variabel memiliki cakupan global, kecuali variabel yang dibuat di dalam fungsi, seperti player_1 di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player_1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Blok <code>if</code> bukan fungsi, jadi <code>player_1</code> tetap memiliki scope global. Atur ke <code>\"Mario\"</code> agar menampilkan <code>Player 1: Mario</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"single_player\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Luigi&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player_1</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Mario\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Access after creating",
            "id": 86997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bahkan dalam scope global, penting bahwa kita hanya bisa mengakses variabel setelah membuatnya, seperti di sini dengan <code>character</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(character)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>character = \"Mario\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>print(character)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel global pun hanya dapat digunakan setelah dibuat.</p><p>Simpan <code>\"Mario\"</code> dalam <code>character</code>, salin nilainya ke <code>message</code>, lalu cetak <code>message</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"character\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message = &quot;character&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(&quot;message&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>character = \"Mario\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>message = character</code>, dan terakhir <code>print(message)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Global scope 1",
